use /lib
from /ui/components/right-sidebar import TasksTab
from /scope/prompt-mode/modes import PromptModes

export anchor MessageListBackgrounds:
    description:
        The header for the latest task shows where it came from by its mode's
        colour, of the @{PromptModes}: a bar in that colour at its left
        and a faint tint of it behind it, as its sent prompt says, never a
        strong fill. A task from the history that doesn't say which mode it
        was sent in has no bar and keeps the tab bar's colour.

        Each task in the Tasks tab hints at the mode it was sent in by the
        bar at its row's left, in that mode's colour, as the @{TasksTab}
        says, never by tinting its whole row.

